{"data":{"id":"10.7302/pa3f-4w30","type":"dois","attributes":{"doi":"10.7302/pa3f-4w30","prefix":"10.7302","suffix":"pa3f-4w30","identifiers":[{"identifier":"https://deepblue.lib.umich.edu/data/concern/data_sets/b2773w109","identifierType":"URL"},{"identifier":"https://deepblue.lib.umich.edu/data/concern/data_sets/b2773w109","identifierType":"URL"}],"alternateIdentifiers":[{"alternateIdentifierType":"URL","alternateIdentifier":"https://deepblue.lib.umich.edu/data/concern/data_sets/b2773w109"},{"alternateIdentifierType":"URL","alternateIdentifier":"https://deepblue.lib.umich.edu/data/concern/data_sets/b2773w109"}],"creators":[{"name":"Weng, Andrew","nameType":null,"givenName":null,"familyName":null,"affiliation":[],"nameIdentifiers":[]}],"titles":[{"lang":null,"title":"Battery test data - fast formation study","titleType":null}],"publisher":"University of Michigan","container":{},"publicationYear":2021,"subjects":[{"subject":"Engineering"}],"contributors":[],"dates":[{"date":"2021-10-26T18:05:58+00:00","dateType":"Updated"},{"date":"2021-09-24T01:08:47+00:00","dateType":"Available"}],"language":null,"types":{"ris":"DATA","bibtex":"misc","citeproc":"dataset","schemaOrg":"Dataset","resourceTypeGeneral":"Dataset"},"relatedIdentifiers":[{"relationType":"HasPart","relatedIdentifier":"https://deepblue.lib.umich.edu/data/concern/file_sets/gh93gz85c","relatedIdentifierType":"URL"},{"relationType":"HasPart","relatedIdentifier":"https://deepblue.lib.umich.edu/data/concern/file_sets/2f75r834n","relatedIdentifierType":"URL"},{"relationType":"IsDocumentedBy","relatedIdentifier":"https://deepblue.lib.umich.edu/data/concern/file_sets/2f75r834n","relatedIdentifierType":"URL"},{"relationType":"IsReferencedBy","relatedIdentifier":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.joule.2021.09.015","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"}],"relatedItems":[],"sizes":[],"formats":[],"version":null,"rightsList":[{"rightsUri":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/"},{"rightsUri":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/"}],"descriptions":[{"lang":"eng","description":"The goal of this research is to investigate the impact of fast formation protocol on battery lifetime. \r\n\r\nThe dataset has also been used to explore data-driven approaches in battery lifetime estimation (manuscript under review). Source code used to generate the results for this work has been included.\r\n\r\nThe file contents contain a detailed README.md file which describes the organization of the files.","descriptionType":"Abstract"},{"lang":"eng","description":"Forty prismatic lithium-ion pouch cells were built at the University of Michigan Battery Laboratory. The cells have a nominal capacity of 2.36Ah and comprise a NCM111 cathode and graphite anode.\r\n\r\nCells were formed using two different formation protocols: \"fast formation\" and \"baseline formation\".\r\n\r\nAfter formation, cells were put under cycle life testing at room temperature and 45degC. Cells were cycled until the discharge capacities dropped below 50% of the initial capacities.\r\n\r\nData was collected by the cycler equipment (Maccor) during both the formation process as well as during the cycling test. Data was processed in the Voltaiq software and subsequently exported as .csv files.","descriptionType":"TechnicalInfo"}],"geoLocations":[],"fundingReferences":[{"funderName":"National Science Foundation (NSF)","awardNumber":"176224"},{"funderName":"National Science Foundation (NSF)","awardNumber":"176224"}],"xml":"","url":"http://deepblue.lib.umich.edu/data/concern/data_sets/b2773w109","contentUrl":null,"metadataVersion":6,"schemaVersion":"http://datacite.org/schema/kernel-4","source":"fabricaForm","isActive":true,"state":"findable","reason":null,"viewCount":0,"viewsOverTime":[],"downloadCount":0,"downloadsOverTime":[],"referenceCount":1,"citationCount":4,"citationsOverTime":[{"year":"2022","total":1},{"year":"2026","total":3}],"partCount":0,"partOfCount":0,"versionCount":0,"versionOfCount":0,"created":"2021-09-22T21:18:54.000Z","registered":"2021-09-22T21:18:54.000Z","published":"2021","updated":"2022-04-10T18:12:55.000Z"},"relationships":{"client":{"data":{"id":"umich.library","type":"clients"}},"provider":{"data":{"id":"umich","type":"providers"}},"media":{"data":{"id":"10.7302/pa3f-4w30","type":"media"}},"references":{"data":[{"id":"10.1016/j.joule.2021.09.015","type":"dois"}]},"citations":{"data":[{"id":"10.1007/s11581-026-07472-5","type":"dois"},{"id":"10.1115/1.4071224","type":"dois"},{"id":"10.7498/aps.75.20251359","type":"dois"},{"id":"10.1016/j.joule.2021.09.015","type":"dois"}]},"parts":{"data":[]},"partOf":{"data":[]},"versions":{"data":[]},"versionOf":{"data":[]}}}}